Define chance as true permanently.
Bind series of number to f0, given (the series of number p0):
    p0 becomes a series of number.
    Pull a rabbit.
        If chance:
            p0 becomes p0.
        Done.
        Otherwise:
            Define v1 as p0.
        Done.
    Done.
    Return p0.
Done.
Bind series of number to f1, given (the series of number p0, the series of series of number p1):
    Pull a rabbit.
        Cast f0 on (p0).
    Done.
    Insert cast f0 on (p0) into p1.
    Pull a rabbit.
        Cast f0 on (p0).
    Done.
    Return p0.
Done.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define v2 as a series of number.
    Pull a rabbit.
        v2 becomes cast f0 on (v2).
    Done.
    Pull a rabbit.
        Define v3 as cast f0 on (v2).
    Done.
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.

